{"unit_id":"tag:0DTF:proof","translation":"由于<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>-不变（invariant）的，显然映射（map）<MATH_0003>通过商（quotient）层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>分解。回顾定义，<MATH_0005>是范畴（category）<MATH_0006>中的余等化子（coequalizer）图表（diagram），该范畴由<MATH_0007>上的集合（sets）的层（sheaves）组成。实际上，这是逗号范畴（category）<MATH_0008>中的余等化子（coequalizer）图表（diagram）。由于基变换（base change）函子（functor）<MATH_0009>是正合（exact）的（这在任意拓扑斯（topos）中都成立），我们得到结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"逗号范畴"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"逗号范畴","context":"逗号范畴中的范畴词核，未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_te