{"unit_id":"tag:0DTG:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。设<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）。设<MATH_0006>为一个<MATH_0007>-不变（invariant）的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），它在<MATH_0008>上。设<MATH_0009>为<MATH_0010>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0011>为引理<REF_0001>中的基变换（base change）。则<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>-纤维积（fibre product），属于<MATH_0014>上的群胚（groupoids）中的栈（stacks）。关于商栈（quotient stacks）及此图表（diagram）中态射（morphisms）的构造，见《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》的<REF_0002>节。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"栈"},{"source_term":"quotient stacks","target_term":"商栈"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"未批准术语。"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积","context":"未批准术语。"},{"s