{"unit_id":"tag:048J:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。设<MATH_0004>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的预关系（relation），它在<MATH_0005>上。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 我们称代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>（在<MATH_0007>上）为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>范畴商（categorical quotient）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果它是<MATH_0008>-不变（invariant）的，并且对每一个<MATH_0009>-不变（invariant）的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>（在<MATH_0011>上），都存在唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>使得<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0014>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）（在<MATH_0015>上）的全子范畴（full subcategory）。假设<MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017>是<MATH_0018>的对象（objects）。在这种情形下，我们称代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0019>（在<MATH_0020>上）为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>范畴商（categorical quotient）（在<MATH_0021>中）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果<MATH_0022>，且<MATH_0023>是<MATH_0024>-不变（invariant）的，并且对每一个<MATH_0025>-不变（invariant）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0026>（满足<MATH_0027>），都存在唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0028>使得<MATH_0029>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 如果<MATH_0030>且<MATH_0031>是<MATH_0032>上的概形（schemes）的范畴（category），则我们称<MATH_0033>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>概形范畴中的范畴商（categorical quotient in the category of schemes）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，或简称为<TEXTITOPEN_0004>概形中的范畴商（categorical quotient in schemes）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"relation","target_term":"预关系"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"categorical quotient","target_term":"范畴商"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","targ